            "id": "0cc2cf85-97d6-4085-8c76-ce5fdde00e20",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you for your fantastic review! We are thrilled to hear that this was your best Seagrove trip yet and that the property suited your large family so well. The private beach and gated community truly make for a special experience. We cannot wait to welcome you back for your next visit!\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Management",
