          {
            "date": "Jul 20, 2025",
            "id": "ab1e3eaf-9f45-48dd-b1d5-5aa93d5a043c",
            "locale": "en_US",
            "response": "Thank you so much for taking the time to share your experience at Sea Turtle Pass! We are glad to hear you enjoyed the convenient location, the private beach access with included chairs and umbrella, and that our team was able to assist you quickly when needed.\n\nWe appreciate your feedback regarding the kitchen and bathroom updates. Those comments have been shared with our team for future improvement planning.\n\nIt is wonderful to know you had a great stay overall, and we’d be happy to welcome you back anytime!\n\nWarm regards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was very clean.\nI was more than happy with the location.\nI was satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nWe enjoyed our stay at sea turtle pass. The location is great, just a short walk to the beach, and close to many little shops and grocery store. The private beach was nice and included two chairs and an umbrella. The house could use some updating (in the bathrooms and kitchen), and we did have a couple issues but things were resolved fairly quickly by texting benchmark. Overall, we enjoyed our time there and would return.",
